    {
      "name": "places/ChIJxTQfVbPtaS4R-S36fWUTRs0/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNsbDhLeUV3EAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I like to go to this place, to work from cafe, fast wifi, but unfortunately this place open abit late everyday, and even later on Wednesday.\nthis place is cash only they seem have no edc machine, and everytime I ask if I can use card they always say \"sorry no\" but you can still scan the QRis payment.\nCoffee is good\nFoods are comforting (such as chicken katsu with fries, mie goreng, donat kampung, dimsum) they are all also cheap here. and price is tax and sc included.\nunfortunately they took out my favorite drink (ice coffee pandan) but their ice coffee signature is still there and taste good too.\nthere is 2nd floor upstairs if you want to stay at indoor smooking room with AC. there is also muathai class next to this coffee shop (in the same area but in the back) overall I will still go here again when am around :)",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "I like to go to this place, to work from cafe, fast wifi, but unfortunately this place open abit late everyday, and even later on Wednesday.\nthis place is cash only they seem have no edc machine, and everytime I ask if I can use card they always say \"sorry no\" but you can still scan the QRis payment.\nCoffee is good\nFoods are comforting (such as chicken katsu with fries, mie goreng, donat kampung, dimsum) they are all also cheap here. and price is tax and sc included.\nunfortunately they took out my favorite drink (ice coffee pandan) but their ice coffee signature is still there and taste good too.\nthere is 2nd floor upstairs if you want to stay at indoor smooking room with AC. there is also muathai class next to this coffee shop (in the same area but in the back) overall I will still go here again when am around :)",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
